{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/thurrock-council-ministerial-response-to-commissioners-sixth-report","content_id":"cc0b491e-cb8c-4535-9c27-d1dd8cde62db","description":"Letter from Alison McGovern MP, the Minister of State for Local Government and Homelessness, in response to Commissioners’ sixth report.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6971084a011505255b2d431f","filename":"Minister_letter_to_Thurrock_Commissioners_Jan_2026.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":165033,"filename":"Minister_letter_to_Thurrock_Commissioners_Jan_2026.pdf","id":"9086174","isbn":"","number_of_pages":2,"title":"Thurrock Council: Ministerial response to Commissioners’ sixth report","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6971084a011505255b2d431f/Minister_letter_to_Thurrock_Commissioners_Jan_2026.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>The letter from Alison McGovern MP, the Minister of State for Local Government and Homelessness, to the Thurrock Commissioners in response to their sixth report.</p>\n\n<p>The letter confirms that the Minister has written to the Leader of the Council to confirm she is content for the Council to initiate a recruitment process for a Chief Executive. This is on the understanding that a suitable, experienced candidate can be recruited and that Commissioners will continue to support and guide the Council throughout this process.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-01-27T14:48:54Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","documents":["<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a